 "_doc": "Forgery routes: cheap ways to produce a claimed piece of evidence WITHOUT the effect being real. cost = how much the route costs a faker while it is OPEN (0 = free, 1 = needs the world's cooperation). A route is CLOSED when ANY clause in closed_if holds on the claim's fields; a field the claim does not state never closes anything (unknown counts as OPEN). ops: == != >= <= > <. kinds = the claim kinds the route applies to. Edit freely; the selftest checks every closes_with names an existing skill folder.",
